 ,{s: 'older age', t: 'in-hospital mortality', fact: 'f_34556ce370450636', doc: 'pubmed/34107481.txt', start: 1584, end: 1703, evidence: 'ICU readmission and age (over 85 years) were independent predictors of in-hospital mortality on multivariable analysis.', confidence: 0.95, run: 'literature_extraction@9b00038fb5d2', runId: 'literature_extraction@9b00038fb5d2@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: '9b00038fb5d29957f1a4c7b2ee263124e8e3f36ea91607373a2d87988fc5b5cb', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-10-15T12:41:45+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'postoperative glycemic variability', t: 'hospital readmission within 30 days', fact: 'f_8e094f15afac5f39', doc: 'pubmed/34474452.txt', start: 1266, end: 1556, evidence: 'In particular, patients with high CV had a higher odds ratio (OR) of readmission (OR = 2.19 [1.17, 4.09]; P = 0.01), experiencing a surgical site infection (OR = 3.22 [1.39, 7.45]; P = 0.01), and undergoing reoperations (OR = 2.65 [1.34, 5.23]; P = 0.01) compared with patients with low CV.', confidence: 0.9, run: 'literature_extraction@9b00038fb5d2', runId: 'literature_extraction@9b00038fb5d2@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: '9b00038fb5d29957f1a4c7b2ee263124e8e3f36ea91607373a2d87988fc5b5cb', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-10-15T12:42:30+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'insulin use', t: 'hospital readmission within 30 days', fact: 'f_5e1354f46b442cf9', doc: 'pubmed/34480653.txt', start: 792, end: 975, evidence: 'Major risk factors for readmission include sociodemographics, comorbidities, insulin use, hospital length of stay (LOS), and history of readmissions, most of which are non-modifiable.', confidence: 0.85, run: 'literature_extraction@9b00038fb5d2', runId: 'literature_extraction@9b00038fb5d2@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: '9b00038fb5d29957f1a4c7b2ee263124e8e3f36ea91607373a2d87988fc5b5cb', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-10-15T12:42:33+00:00'}
