 ,{s: 'metformin', t: 'ibuprofen', fact: 'f_a45b1c5c74b934a3', doc: 'openfda/glipizide-and-metformin.txt', start: 37264, end: 37439, evidence: 'In healthy volunteers, the pharmacokinetics of metformin and propranolol, and metformin and ibuprofen were not affected when coadministered in single-dose interaction studies.', confidence: 0.9, run: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277', runId: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: 'fc3d922aa27751cd23bc5136339e3e9669ebbfd16084612234d8ae7245fceda4', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-10-15T12:07:00+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'glipizide', t: 'fluconazole', fact: 'f_9c71c904d15c2a97', doc: 'openfda/glipizide.txt', start: 16791, end: 16944, evidence: 'The effect of concomitant administration of fluconazole and glipizide has been demonstrated in a placebo-controlled crossover study in normal volunteers.', confidence: 0.9, run: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277', runId: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: 'fc3d922aa27751cd23bc5136339e3e9669ebbfd16084612234d8ae7245fceda4', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-10-15T12:08:34+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'glipizide', t: 'colesevelam', fact: 'f_e73cd83d38fcf389', doc: 'openfda/glipizide.txt', start: 17185, end: 17435, evidence: 'In studies assessing the effect of colesevelam on the pharmacokinetics of glipizide ER in healthy volunteers, reductions in glipizide AUC 0-∞ and C max of 12% and 13%, respectively, were observed when colesevelam was coadministered with glipizide ER.', confidence: 0.9, run: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277', runId: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: 'fc3d922aa27751cd23bc5136339e3e9669ebbfd16084612234d8ae7245fceda4', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-10-15T12:08:34+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'glipizide', t: 'colesevelam', fact: 'f_1f333d4196a9abdd', doc: 'openfda/glipizide.txt', start: 17436, end: 17590, evidence: 'When glipizide ER was administered 4 hours prior to colesevelam, there was no significant change in glipizide AUC 0-∞ or C max , –4% and 0%, respectively.', confidence: 0.9, run: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277', runId: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: 'fc3d922aa27751cd23bc5136339e3e9669ebbfd16084612234d8ae7245fceda4', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-10-15T12:08:34+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'metformin', t: 'furosemide', fact: 'f_79e0bc772120858e', doc: 'openfda/glipizide.txt', start: 17816, end: 17992, evidence: 'A single-dose, metformin-furosemide drug interaction study in healthy subjects demonstrated that pharmacokinetic parameters of both compounds were affected by coadministration.', confidence: 0.95, run: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277', runId: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: 'fc3d922aa27751cd23bc5136339e3e9669ebbfd16084612234d8ae7245fceda4', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-10-15T12:08:34+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'metformin', t: 'nifedipine', fact: 'f_9ce44bb169faef9c', doc: 'openfda/glipizide.txt', start: 18510, end: 18764, evidence: 'A single-dose, metformin-nifedipine drug interaction study in normal healthy volunteers demonstrated that coadministration of nifedipine increased plasma metformin C max and AUC by 20% and 9%, respectively, and increased the amount excreted in the urine.', confidence: 0.95, run: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277', runId: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: 'fc3d922aa27751cd23bc5136339e3e9669ebbfd16084612234d8ae7245fceda4', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-10-15T12:08:34+00:00'}
