 ,{s: 'nateglinide', t: 'hypoglycemia', fact: 'f_957a839495ca8ac7', doc: 'openfda/nateglinide.txt', start: 11383, end: 11521, evidence: 'Because the potential for hypoglycemia in breast-fed infants, advise women that use of nateglinide is not recommended while breastfeeding.', confidence: 0.9, run: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277', runId: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: 'fc3d922aa27751cd23bc5136339e3e9669ebbfd16084612234d8ae7245fceda4', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-10-15T12:15:16+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'pioglitazone', t: 'heart failure', fact: 'f_da616cb60a92038d', doc: 'openfda/pioglitazone.txt', start: 274, end: 420, evidence: 'Thiazolidinediones, including pioglitazone , cause or exacerbate congestive heart failure in some patients [see Warnings and Precautions (5.1) ] .', confidence: 0.95, run: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277', runId: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: 'fc3d922aa27751cd23bc5136339e3e9669ebbfd16084612234d8ae7245fceda4', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-10-15T12:15:54+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'pioglitazone', t: 'heart failure', fact: 'f_9004a79fcdd6e2bd', doc: 'openfda/pioglitazone.txt', start: 3421, end: 3502, evidence: 'Fluid retention may occur and can exacerbate or lead to congestive heart failure.', confidence: 0.95, run: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277', runId: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: 'fc3d922aa27751cd23bc5136339e3e9669ebbfd16084612234d8ae7245fceda4', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-10-15T12:15:54+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'pioglitazone', t: 'hepatic failure', fact: 'f_e2b0288779d4ccbd', doc: 'openfda/pioglitazone.txt', start: 3844, end: 3902, evidence: 'Postmarketing reports of hepatic failure, sometimes fatal.', confidence: 0.9, run: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277', runId: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: 'fc3d922aa27751cd23bc5136339e3e9669ebbfd16084612234d8ae7245fceda4', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-10-15T12:15:54+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'pioglitazone', t: 'bladder cancer', fact: 'f_29b3d8cead32a72f', doc: 'openfda/pioglitazone.txt', start: 4214, end: 4254, evidence: 'May increase the risk of bladder cancer.', confidence: 0.95, run: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277', runId: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: 'fc3d922aa27751cd23bc5136339e3e9669ebbfd16084612234d8ae7245fceda4', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-10-15T12:15:54+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'pioglitazone', t: 'edema', fact: 'f_cb29b35bdb6236b4', doc: 'openfda/pioglitazone.txt', start: 10309, end: 10465, evidence: 'In controlled clinical trials, edema was reported more frequently in patients treated with pioglitazone than in placebo-treated patients and is dose-related', confidence: 0.95, run: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277', runId: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: 'fc3d922aa27751cd23bc5136339e3e9669ebbfd16084612234d8ae7245fceda4', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-10-15T12:15:54+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'pioglitazone', t: 'bone fracture', fact: 'f_5fccdda2d94d8f39', doc: 'openfda/pioglitazone.txt', start: 11383, end: 11533, evidence: 'During a mean follow-up of 34.5 months, the incidence of bone fracture in females was 5.1% (44/870) for pioglitazone versus 2.5% (23/905) for placebo.', confidence: 0.92, run: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277', runId: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: 'fc3d922aa27751cd23bc5136339e3e9669ebbfd16084612234d8ae7245fceda4', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-10-15T12:15:54+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'pioglitazone', t: 'macular edema', fact: 'f_8f1aba29796693a8', doc: 'openfda/pioglitazone.txt', start: 12133, end: 12272, evidence: 'Macular edema has been reported in postmarketing experience in diabetic patients who were taking pioglitazone or another thiazolidinedione.', confidence: 0.95, run: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277', runId: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: 'fc3d922aa27751cd23bc5136339e3e9669ebbfd16084612234d8ae7245fceda4', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-10-15T12:15:54+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'pioglitazone', t: 'heart failure', fact: 'f_5334c2c0e4ae1bf5', doc: 'openfda/pioglitazone.txt', start: 13189, end: 13269, evidence: 'Congestive heart failure [see Boxed Warning and Warnings and Precautions (5.1) ]', confidence: 0.9, run: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277', runId: 'drug_label_extraction@fc3d922aa277@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: 'fc3d922aa27751cd23bc5136339e3e9669ebbfd16084612234d8ae7245fceda4', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-10-15T12:15:54+00:00'}
