 ,{s: 'recommend potent statins combined with ezetimibe and, if necessary, other lipid-lowering drugs for patients at hospital discharge after an ischaemic cardiovascular event', t: 'bempedoic acid', fact: 'f_f8021e0d936624f1', doc: 'pubmed/39551547.txt', start: 706, end: 904, evidence: 'Strategies include rigorous control of lipid levels, recommending potent statins combined with ezetimibe and, if necessary, other drugs such as inclisiran, evolocumab, alirocumab, or bempedoic acid.', confidence: 0.85, run: 'guideline_extraction@9a20634981a4', runId: 'guideline_extraction@9a20634981a4@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: '9a20634981a4d5610008f111dfa602adaad743c48baa8bd5b7384c8b98fb8af1', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-11-01T19:01:17+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'adjust insulin dosage when adding sglt-2 inhibitors or glp-1 receptor agonists to avoid hypoglycaemia', t: 'insulin', fact: 'f_55e50b409d541db2', doc: 'pubmed/39551547.txt', start: 983, end: 1188, evidence: 'For patients already on insulin, it is essential to adjust the dosage when adding SGLT-2 inhibitors (SGLT2i) or GLP-1 receptor agonists (GLP-1RA) to avoid hypoglycaemia, with structured glucose monitoring.', confidence: 0.9, run: 'guideline_extraction@9a20634981a4', runId: 'guideline_extraction@9a20634981a4@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: '9a20634981a4d5610008f111dfa602adaad743c48baa8bd5b7384c8b98fb8af1', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-11-01T19:01:17+00:00'}
