 ,{s: 'adjust insulin dosage when adding sglt-2 inhibitors or glp-1 receptor agonists to avoid hypoglycaemia', t: 'glp-1 receptor agonists', fact: 'f_807f517c744c9012', doc: 'pubmed/39551547.txt', start: 983, end: 1188, evidence: 'For patients already on insulin, it is essential to adjust the dosage when adding SGLT-2 inhibitors (SGLT2i) or GLP-1 receptor agonists (GLP-1RA) to avoid hypoglycaemia, with structured glucose monitoring.', confidence: 0.9, run: 'guideline_extraction@9a20634981a4', runId: 'guideline_extraction@9a20634981a4@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: '9a20634981a4d5610008f111dfa602adaad743c48baa8bd5b7384c8b98fb8af1', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-11-01T19:01:17+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'continue glucagon-like peptide-1 receptor agonists and dual glucose-dependent insulinotropic peptide receptor agonists before surgery', t: 'glp-1 receptor agonists', fact: 'f_eb871d57de35e310', doc: 'pubmed/39781571.txt', start: 1410, end: 1579, evidence: 'Patients taking glucagon-like peptide-1 receptor agonists and dual glucose-dependent insulinotropic peptide receptor agonists should: continue these drugs before surgery', confidence: 0.92, run: 'guideline_extraction@9a20634981a4', runId: 'guideline_extraction@9a20634981a4@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: '9a20634981a4d5610008f111dfa602adaad743c48baa8bd5b7384c8b98fb8af1', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-11-01T19:01:33+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'omit sodium-glucose cotransporter-2 inhibitors the day before and the day of a procedure', t: 'sglt2 inhibitors', fact: 'f_c4229b09ea9a0f80', doc: 'pubmed/39781571.txt', start: 1770, end: 1887, evidence: 'Patients taking sodium-glucose cotransporter-2 inhibitors should omit them the day before and the day of a procedure.', confidence: 0.92, run: 'guideline_extraction@9a20634981a4', runId: 'guideline_extraction@9a20634981a4@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: '9a20634981a4d5610008f111dfa602adaad743c48baa8bd5b7384c8b98fb8af1', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-11-01T19:01:33+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'treat hyperglycemia with basal-bolus insulin alone or with correction', t: 'insulin', fact: 'f_9f44fe2643369ae5', doc: 'pubmed/40117466.txt', start: 1420, end: 1597, evidence: 'Hyperglycemia treatment with basal-bolus insulin alone (n = 3) or with correction (n = 5) was most commonly recommended, while sliding scale insulin was advised against (n = 5).', confidence: 0.9, run: 'guideline_extraction@9a20634981a4', runId: 'guideline_extraction@9a20634981a4@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: '9a20634981a4d5610008f111dfa602adaad743c48baa8bd5b7384c8b98fb8af1', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-11-01T19:01:44+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'continue regular diabetes medicines whenever safe instead of switching to intravenous insulin', t: 'insulin', fact: 'f_8a6a4ae7eb15dd06', doc: 'pubmed/41696887.txt', start: 3321, end: 3448, evidence: 'continuing their regular diabetes medicines whenever it is safe to do so, instead of switching to insulin given through a vein.', confidence: 0.85, run: 'guideline_extraction@9a20634981a4', runId: 'guideline_extraction@9a20634981a4@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: '9a20634981a4d5610008f111dfa602adaad743c48baa8bd5b7384c8b98fb8af1', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-11-01T19:02:03+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'take daily doses of insulin, either by injection or through a special pump', t: 'insulin', fact: 'f_1b9a1379aad6f2c9', doc: 'medlineplus/diabetes.txt', start: 4462, end: 4583, evidence: 'If you have type 1 diabetes, you will need to take daily doses of insulin, either by injection or through a special pump.', confidence: 0.95, run: 'patient_education_extraction@6fb3bf908974', runId: 'patient_education_extraction@6fb3bf908974@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: '6fb3bf908974d1d5f147589cd6258432e2d6cb32a95cd8a052d4c74c03d75f00', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-10-15T12:20:26+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'you may need antibiotics and/or surgery.', t: 'antibiotics', fact: 'f_e517c4bfcda0fac5', doc: 'medlineplus/fistulas.txt', start: 648, end: 703, evidence: 'In some cases, you may need antibiotics and/or surgery.', confidence: 0.9, run: 'patient_education_extraction@6fb3bf908974', runId: 'patient_education_extraction@6fb3bf908974@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: '6fb3bf908974d1d5f147589cd6258432e2d6cb32a95cd8a052d4c74c03d75f00', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-10-15T12:21:42+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'take aspirin in the second trimester, if you are at risk of preeclampsia and your provider recommends aspirin.', t: 'aspirin', fact: 'f_f0f505d1df216cda', doc: 'medlineplus/high-blood-pressure-in-pregnancy.txt', start: 5513, end: 5623, evidence: 'Take aspirin in the second trimester, if you are at risk of preeclampsia and your provider recommends aspirin.', confidence: 0.95, run: 'patient_education_extraction@6fb3bf908974', runId: 'patient_education_extraction@6fb3bf908974@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: '6fb3bf908974d1d5f147589cd6258432e2d6cb32a95cd8a052d4c74c03d75f00', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-10-15T12:22:15+00:00'}
 ,{s: 'take one of a few types of diabetes medicines if you are at high risk', t: 'diabetes medicines', fact: 'f_6b6471ea9ca57f6c', doc: 'medlineplus/how-to-prevent-diabetes.txt', start: 3817, end: 3923, evidence: 'If you are at high risk, your provider may suggest that you take one of a few types of diabetes medicines.', confidence: 0.9, run: 'patient_education_extraction@6fb3bf908974', runId: 'patient_education_extraction@6fb3bf908974@gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', hash: '6fb3bf908974d1d5f147589cd6258432e2d6cb32a95cd8a052d4c74c03d75f00', llm: 'gemini/gemini-3.5-flash-lite', policy: 'f20cdba4b6a0133d1db0677e5c18d6c31c2c50e396d718c04900094dffbe3b6a', ts: '2026-10-15T12:22:30+00:00'}
